  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "1.0.0: Publish under the package ID BulkStepBuilder and promote the user-validated 0.1.7 implementation to the 1.0 release line. NuGet package version is 1.0.0 and assembly version is 1.0.0.0. Package identity, release numbering and documentation changed; plugin registration behavior is unchanged. Includes explicit class selection, searchable tables, per-table Update attributes, batch preview, duplicate detection, signing guidance, actionable errors and CSV export.",
